    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CHESS</strong><br><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158990/extras/cdf733c6a92636f85bf27d278ce374a8.avif?t=1750942816\" width=660 height=120 /></span><strong>Themed Chess: Relaxing Minimalistic Strategy Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Themed Chess</i> offers a relaxing and minimalist approach to the classic chess game. With multiple gameplay options, beautiful themed boards, and a variety of chess pieces, it's perfect for casual players and strategy lovers alike. Whether you prefer to play against AI or challenge other players, this game offers endless enjoyment with many customization options.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2654 <strong>Free to Play</strong> \u2013 Start playing now, no cost involved!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2655 <strong>Relaxing Minimalistic Style</strong> \u2013 A calm and peaceful design for an immersive chess experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2656 <strong>Multiple Chess Boards &amp; Piece Sets</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a variety of beautiful, themed sets and boards with even more coming soon via DLCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2657 <strong>AI with 3 Difficulty Levels</strong> \u2013 Challenge yourself with varying AI difficulties, suitable for both beginners and advanced players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2658 <strong>Play Against Other Players</strong> \u2013 Compete in multiplayer mode with friends or players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2659 <strong>3D Gameplay &amp; Clear 2D Mini Board</strong> \u2013 Switch between a dynamic 3D view or a simplified 2D board for a more focused experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2659 <strong>Chess History &amp; Rules</strong> \u2013 Learn the game\u2019s history and rules in the integrated section for both new players and chess enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2659 <strong>RPG DLC &amp; More</strong> \u2013 Enjoy exciting DLC content, including RPG-themed chess sets and more on the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Themed Chess</i> is perfect for chess lovers who appreciate a relaxing, customizable experience with lots of options to explore. Download the base game for <strong>FREE</strong> today and immerse yourself in a calm, strategic world of chess!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CALL TO ACTION:</strong><br>\u2b50 Add <i>Themed Chess</i> to your <strong>Wishlist</strong> now to stay updated on future DLCs and releases!<br>\ud83d\udc4d <strong>Follow</strong> the game for news and updates!<br>\ud83d\udcac <strong>Leave a Comments\u00a0</strong>and share your thoughts to help us improve!</h2>",
